Title: Crews tackle fire at industrial site as smoke seen miles away
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Lancashire Fire and Rescue Service (LFRS) spokesperson', 'Text': 'working as fast as they can to extinguish the fire safely', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 100, 'EndChar': 150}}, {'Speaker': 'LFRS group manager Mark Warwick', 'Text': 'giving off large volumes of smoke', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 30, 'EndChar': 60}}, {'Speaker': 'LFRS group manager Mark Warwick', 'Text': 'if you see or smell any smoke in the area, please keep windows and doors closed.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 66, 'EndChar': 140}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Firefighters have been tackling a fire at a commercial premises in Lancashire which has caused large plumes of smoke to be spotted by people miles away.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 126}}, {'Description': 'No injuries have been reported and smoke has been seen billowing out above the site.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 78}}, {'Description': 'Eight fire engines were sent to the scene and a spokesperson said the service was "working as fast as they can to extinguish the fire safely".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 150}}, {'Description': 'Nearby roads have been closed, including part of the Bay Gateway, as crews tackle the blaze.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 89}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'A large plume of smoke can be seen billowing above the sands of Morecambe Bay with hills in the background.'}]}
